What this covers
----------------

- The structured data the pipeline produces: data/processed/,
  data/output/, data/digest-archive/, data/known_notification_dates.json,
  data/frozen_events_mergers.json, and the generated files under
  frontend/public/data/ (served at https://mergers.fyi/data/).
- The hand-curated material within it, such as commentary, related-party
  groupings, related-merger links and the Tribunal and Federal Court review
  overlays.
- The fyi.mergers.* records this project publishes to the AT Protocol
  network.

